  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "4f605d38-814e-42a5-9568-b4829eedaa0b",
    "name": "Skydance Media Content API (WordPress REST wp/v2) Statuses API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Skydance Media publishes skydance.com on WordPress, which exposes the WordPress REST API at https://skydance.com/wp-json/. The wp/v2 namespace is anonymously readable and returns the site's pages, media library, categories, tags and a site-wide search endpoint as JSON.\n\nThis document was DERIVED mechanically by API Evangelist from the route-discovery document served at https://skydance.com/wp-json/ on 2026-08-05 — every path, method and parameter below is taken verbatim from that descriptor. Skydance Media does not publish an OpenAPI definition of its own, and this is not a product API: it is the content API the CMS exposes. Write operations exist on these routes but require authentication (WordPress Application Passwords over HTTP Basic); anonymous callers receive HTTP 401 rest_forbidden.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Skydance Media",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
